# Prettier differences

```diff
--- Prettier
+++ Biome
@@ -1,3 +1,3 @@
 <template>
-  <span>{{ a || b }} {{ z && a && b }}</span>
+  <span>{{ (a||          b) }} {{ z&&(a&&b) }}</span>
 </template>
```

# Output

```vue
<template>
  <span>{{ (a||          b) }} {{ z&&(a&&b) }}</span>
</template>
